  "findings": [
    "DNR current records 3862 and 3863 are state-owned unimproved carry-ins, not abandoned. Original facility coordinates and stable IDs preserved.",
    "DNR property map revised October 23, 2024 identifies boat access; current property page allows canoeing but describes active wetland management including drawdowns.",
    "Three imagery views inspected: Deerview context, Highway G dam/landing close view, and Highway G broader context. Hwy G original facility marker is on the upstream marsh side of the dike; no exact landing or bank is inferred.",
    "DNR dam 861 remains On Landscape. Its presence does not prevent an access-area map for a trip ending above the structure; outlet warning retained. No dam passage or portage claimed.",
    "Bridge Creek pond-to-Harstad hold retained; no substituted private bridge launch."
  ],
